# P1: Project Folder and Terminal Navigation

## Aim
To learn how to create project folders and
navigate through directories using Terminal.

## Tools Used
- macOS Terminal
- Git
- GitHub

## Commands Practiced

### 1. pwd
Displays the current working directory.

### 2. ls
Lists files and folders.

### 3. mkdir
Creates a new directory.

### 4. cd
Changes the current directory.

### 5. cd ..
Moves one directory backward.

### 6. clear
Clears the terminal screen.

## Project Structure

P01-project-folder/
- code/
- screenshots/
- README.md

## Learning Outcome
Learned basic terminal navigation and
project folder management.

